From 56273c48532b685a86f28756fb376f5fa0f7851a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Javier Maestro <jjmaestro@ieee.org>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 09:00:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] patch: move to pgrx 0.18 for an offline, sandboxed build

1.6.1 ships against pgrx 0.16, whose only route to the extension SQL is a
generated `pgrx_embed` binary: it is compiled in a second pass and RUN, and its
stdout is the SQL. A network-less sandbox cannot allow that, and a cross-compile
cannot do it at all. 0.18 instead records the SQL entity graph in a `.pgrxsc`
link section, so the same SQL can be read out of the built library as data
by a small external tool. `pgrx_embed` is gone in 0.18, so its `[[bin]]` and the
one-line source behind it go with it.

0.18.1 rather than 0.18.0: 0.18.0 emits the section but lets the linker garbage
collect it on aarch64 Linux, where nothing references it, leaving an extension
with no SQL at all (pgrx #2280).

The requirement is exact (`=`) because the SQL is emitted by a generator built
against one pgrx release, and both halves of that release matter. The `.pgrxsc`
wire format happens to be unchanged in 0.19, so a mismatch would not fail
loudly; but 0.19 changed the emitter behind it (schema qualification and type
resolution), and this extension declares `schema = 'graphql'` in its control
file, so it sits squarely on the changed behaviour. A resolver free to pick 0.19
here would pair a 0.19 library with the 0.18 emitter and quietly write different
SQL.

References: https://github.com/pgcentralfoundation/pgrx/issues/2280
---
 Cargo.toml            | 8 ++------
 src/bin/pgrx_embed.rs | 1 -
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 src/bin/pgrx_embed.rs

diff --git a/Cargo.toml b/Cargo.toml
index 1cb06b4..c282798 100644
--- a/Cargo.toml
+++ b/Cargo.toml
@@ -6,10 +6,6 @@ edition = "2024"
 [lib]
 crate-type = ["cdylib", "lib"]
 
-[[bin]]
-name = "pgrx_embed_pg_graphql"
-path = "./src/bin/pgrx_embed.rs"
-
 [features]
 default = ["pg18"]
 pg14 = ["pgrx/pg14", "pgrx-tests/pg14"]
@@ -20,7 +16,7 @@ pg18 = ["pgrx/pg18", "pgrx-tests/pg18"]
 pg_test = []
 
 [dependencies]
-pgrx = "=0.16.1"
+pgrx = "=0.18.1"
 graphql-parser = "0.4"
 serde = { version = "1.0", features = ["rc"] }
 serde_json = "1.0"
@@ -37,7 +33,7 @@ indexmap = "2.2"
 thiserror = "2.0"
 
 [dev-dependencies]
-pgrx-tests = "=0.16.1"
+pgrx-tests = "=0.18.1"
 
 [profile.dev]
 panic = "unwind"
diff --git a/src/bin/pgrx_embed.rs b/src/bin/pgrx_embed.rs
deleted file mode 100644
index 5f5c4d8..0000000
--- a/src/bin/pgrx_embed.rs
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1 +0,0 @@
-::pgrx::pgrx_embed!();
